{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827680490881095","content":"Lady Cecelia was the noble woman Lilia working for when the ship she was on crashed. Lilia looked up to her generosity and love of life, but also her quick wit and charm. She is the reason Lilia knows what to say and when while also coming from a place of compassion and love. After her death on the ship wreck, Lilia promised herself to live by Lady Cecelia's words. To not be ashamed of who you are regardless of what others might think. \n\nWhen Lilia see's her face, she grabs at her necklace with the Raven Queen's symbol and says a small prayer for her.","created_at":"2020-08-21T02:54:03.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746200419444981772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
